  "Gate test vectors. Run with known_good_fixture as the Tranco set (NOT the real 100k list) so results are deterministic, brand_domains.json and gate_lists.json from contracts/, an empty safe-verdict cache, and the bundled PSL (contracts/public_suffix_list.dat, private section included).",
  "expect.host = normalized ASCII host (lowercase, punycode, no port/userinfo/trailing dot; IPv6 kept in brackets). registrable_domain = eTLD+1 by PSL incl. private rules, null for IPs/public suffixes/single labels.",
  "Input without a scheme but with a dot and no spaces is treated as https://<input>. punycode/homoglyph are checked only when present in expect.",
